  </data>
  <data name="DATASET_CSV_DESCRIPTION" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A series of CSV files in row, col, values* format, as exported by Ecospace. Note that these files lack any spatial reference, and are intended to be used only with the Ecospace scenario from which they were generated.</value>
